n-   [About VectorBuilder](/about-us/about-vectorbuilder.html)\n-   [Our Team](/about-us/our-team.html)\n-   [Newsroom](/about-us/newsroom.html)\n-   [Upcoming Events](/about-us/upcoming-event/Americas.html)\n-   [Careers](/about-us/careers.html)\n-   [Legal Information](/about-us/legal-statement.html)\n-   [Contact Us](/about-us/contact.html)\n\n1.  [Home](/)\n2.  About Us\n3.  Newsroom\n\n# Newsroom\n\n[![VectorBuilder to Present at the ASHG 2026 Annual Meeting](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/69087029e9185ad308c1628c3cb72e83679d8a6e/ASHG.png)](/about-us/newsroom/vectoruilder-to-present-at-the-ashg-2026-annual-meeting.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder to Present at the ASHG 2026 Annual Meeting](/about-us/newsroom/vectoruilder-to-present-at-the-ashg-2026-annual-meeting.html)\n\nOct 15, 2026\n\nVectorBuilder today announced that it will present and exhibit at the American Society of Human Genetics (ASHG) 2026 Annual Meeting, taking place October 20–24 in Montréal, Canada, and that Dr. Morgan Dwyer will present during the meeting. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectoruilder-to-present-at-the-ashg-2026-annual-meeting.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder and Lir Therapeutics Partner to Advance AAV Capsids Designed for Clinical Success](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/8f661bdc03582612d3e04b3665284ac1d81bd5e4/cover4%EF%BC%9A3.jpg)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-lir-therapeutics-advance-aav-capsids.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder and Lir Therapeutics Partner to Advance AAV Capsids Designed for Clinical Success](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-lir-therapeutics-advance-aav-capsids.html)\n\nAug 18, 2026\n\nVectorBuilder, a global leader in gene delivery technologies, and Lir Therapeutics, a company pushing the boundaries of vector engineering with AI, today announced a strategic collaboration to develop adeno-associated virus (AAV) capsids designed not only for strong biological performance, but also for the manufacturability and scalability required to bring gene therapies into the clinic. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-lir-therapeutics-advance-aav-capsids.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder Advances Free VectorBee Software to Help Researchers Work with Greater Control and Flexibility](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/bace8c8a02c06ca570213e31f52854e51493257c/VectorBee-front.jpg)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-upgrades-free-vectorbee.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder Advances Free VectorBee Software to Help Researchers Work with Greater Control and Flexibility](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-upgrades-free-vectorbee.html)\n\nJul 14, 2026\n\nVectorBuilder has launched a major upgrade to VectorBee, its free DNA software. The enhanced version gives researchers greater control over DNA and protein sequence design while streamlining the journey from vector design to ordering. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-upgrades-free-vectorbee.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder Partners with MaxCyte<sup>®</sup>  to Advance Clinical-Grade Cell Engineering](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/2469ef9d1e47489e26a4029f1c3370245b4d265e/VB%26maxcyte.jpg)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-partners-with-maxcyte.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder Partners with MaxCyte® to Advance Clinical-Grade Cell Engineering](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-partners-with-maxcyte.html)\n\nJun 23, 2026\n\nVectorBuilder and MaxCyte have entered into a strategic partnership to co-develop a novel platform technology for ex vivo cell engineering. The collaboration integrates VectorBuilder’s proprietary MiniVec™ plasmid system with MaxCyte’s clinical-grade electroporation platform to advance next-generation cell therapy development. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-partners-with-maxcyte.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder to Invest $50 Million in Chicago Biomanufacturing and R&D Center](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/9a26e9fbcc04ebf1a710c7b1439e446186088e9e/%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%88%E6%96%B0%EF%BC%89.jpg)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-to-build-chicago-biomanufacturing-center.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder to Invest $50 Million in Chicago Biomanufacturing and R&D Center](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-to-build-chicago-biomanufacturing-center.html)\n\nMay 27, 2026\n\nVectorBuilder, a global leader in gene delivery technologies, today announced plans to invest $50 million to establish a new Advanced Biomanufacturing and R&D Center in Chicago, marking a major expansion of the company’s regional operations and long-term commitment to supporting the development of genetic medicines. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-to-build-chicago-biomanufacturing-center.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder to Present on Therapeutic Vector Design at ASGCT 2026](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/bb0359504155a3272c21f8be5b4db7fba2db6dd8/ASGCT-2026.jpg)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-to-present-at-asgct-2026.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder to Present on Therapeutic Vector Design at ASGCT 2026](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-to-present-at-asgct-2026.html)\n\nMay 07, 2026\n\nVectorBuilder, a global leader in gene delivery technologies and CDMO solutions, will participate in the American Society of Gene & Cell Therapy (ASGCT) Annual Meeting, taking place May 11 to 15 in Boston, Massachusetts. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-to-present-at-asgct-2026.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder Secures European Patent for MiniVec™, a Plasmid Backbone Advancing Safety and Manufacturability in Genetic Medicine](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/70e5d1896d1270d929da485e91b07e0f000d2b39/miniVec%20Patent%20Front%20Cover.png)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-secures-european-patent-for-minivec.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder Secures European Patent for MiniVec™, a Plasmid Backbone Advancing Safety and Manufacturability in Genetic Medicine](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-secures-european-patent-for-minivec.html)\n\nMay 05, 2026\n\nVectorBuilder today announced that its MiniVec™ plasmid system has been granted a European patent, marking a significant milestone for the company’s proprietary plasmid DNA technology and reinforcing its position at the forefront of gene delivery innovation. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-secures-european-patent-for-minivec.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder to Present on Advancing AAV-Based Therapies at ARVO 2026](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/d6cd0bc4a448b71acfb723f5f7ab4541dc700705/ARVO%202026.png)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-to-present-at-arvo-2026.html)\n\n[VectorBuilder to Present on Advancing AAV-Based Therapies at ARVO 2026](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-to-present-at-arvo-2026.html)\n\nApr 30, 2026\n\nVectorBuilder, a global leader in gene delivery technologies and CDMO solutions, will participate in the Association for Research in Vision and Ophthalmology (ARVO) Annual Meeting, taking place in Denver, Colorado, from May 3 to 7. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-to-present-at-arvo-2026.html)\n\n[![Nobel-Potential Discovery from VectorBuilder Scientists Reveals Fundamental Mechanisms of Development](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/07b90ac7ea5732af35191ca04e8df4caea2bfa65/Fundamental%20Mechanisms%20of%20Development.png)](/about-us/newsroom/discovery-reveals-fundamental-mechanisms.html)\n\n[Nobel-Potential Discovery from VectorBuilder Scientists Reveals Fundamental Mechanisms of Development](/about-us/newsroom/discovery-reveals-fundamental-mechanisms.html)\n\nApr 21, 2026\n\nOne of the most fundamental questions in biology is how a single fertilized egg produces the diverse cell types making up the body that bear the same genetic blueprint but distinct expression patterns. Now, a research team lead by Dr. Bruce Lahn has uncovered fundamental mechanisms driving this process. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/discovery-reveals-fundamental-mechanisms.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder Introduces High-Stability MuteFree™ AAV to Improve Gene Therapy Manufacturing Reliability](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/e7d265f13aff324badce46448856805f99f6e208/MuteFree%20AAV.jpg)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-introduces-mutefree-aav-to-improve-manufacturing-reliability.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder Introduces High-Stability MuteFree™ AAV to Improve Gene Therapy Manufacturing Reliability](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-introduces-mutefree-aav-to-improve-manufacturing-reliability.html)\n\nApr 14, 2026\n\nVectorBuilder, a global leader in gene delivery technologies and CDMO solutions, today announced MuteFree™ AAV, a high-stability AAV vector designed to address ITR instability, a common challenge in gene therapy development. The manuscript describing the technology is now available on bioRxiv. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-introduces-mutefree-aav-to-improve-manufacturing-reliability.html)\n\n[![Ikarovec to advance pipeline with exclusive worldwide option to VectorBuilder’s Intravitreal Capsid Technology](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/40b7a515f4a8b9e62bb3526529e45844cbc3964d/%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%88%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%EF%BC%89.jpg)](/about-us/newsroom/ikarovec-to-advance-pipeline-with-exclusive-option-to-vectorbuilders-capsid-technology.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[Ikarovec to advance pipeline with exclusive worldwide option to VectorBuilder’s Intravitreal Capsid Technology](/about-us/newsroom/ikarovec-to-advance-pipeline-with-exclusive-option-to-vectorbuilders-capsid-technology.html)\n\nJan 06, 2026\n\nIkarovec Ltd and VectorBuilder have entered into an exclusive worldwide option agreement for VectorBuilder’s novel AAV capsid technology to be used in combination with Ikarovec’s gene therapy candidate IKAR-003 for intermediate age-related macular degeneration (AMD). [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/ikarovec-to-advance-pipeline-with-exclusive-option-to-vectorbuilders-capsid-technology.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder Redefines Plasmid Standards with MiniVec<sup>TM</sup>](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/c1184c57c6dfe04b1f6c6eaaf3d50c325d6b3132/MiniVec.jpg)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-redefines-plasmid-standards-with-minivec.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder Redefines Plasmid Standards with MiniVecTM](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-redefines-plasmid-standards-with-minivec.html)\n\nOct 08, 2025\n\nVectorBuilder, a global leader in gene delivery technologies and CDMO services, today announced the publication of the MiniVec plasmid system, engineered for safer, more efficient, and more scalable development of genetic medicines. The manuscript detailing this breakthrough is now published on BioRxiv. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-redefines-plasmid-standards-with-minivec.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder Wins Two IMAPAC Awards, Cementing Leadership in Gene Therapy and CDMO Innovation](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/2deef87bea5b21b834871f6c6fd0db58e3cd4b46/CDMO%20Award.png)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-wins-two-imapac-awards.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder Wins Two IMAPAC Awards, Cementing Leadership in Gene Therapy and CDMO Innovation](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-wins-two-imapac-awards.html)\n\nSep 30, 2025\n\nVectorBuilder, a global leader in the gene delivery space, has won two prestigious awards at the Asia-Pacific Cell and Gene Therapy Excellence Awards 2025 (APCGTEA) and the Asia-Pacific Biologics CDMO Excellence Awards 2025 (APBCEA), hosted by IMAPAC. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-wins-two-imapac-awards.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder Honored with 2025 CDMO Leadership Award for CGT Global Category](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/e7e7492621dd2309cd63eb75862815abfc866cef/CDMO_Leadership.jpg)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-honored-2025-cdmo-leadership-award.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder Honored with 2025 CDMO Leadership Award for CGT Global Category](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-honored-2025-cdmo-leadership-award.html)\n\nApr 30, 2025\n\nVectorBuilder, a global leader in gene delivery and technology, proudly announces that it has been awarded the \"CDMO Leadership Award - Cell & Gene Therapy, Global Category\" in the annual selection jointly hosted by Outsourced Pharma and Life Science Connect. The award recognizes VectorBuilder’s performance in key areas such as quality, reliability, and technical capability. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-honored-2025-cdmo-leadership-award.html)\n\n[![VectorBuilder and EurekaBio Join Forces to Reduce Viral Vector Manufacturing Costs](https://assets.vectorbuilder.com/s-link/1d7a0527bd0dadb4240c952d9c1c6ab6e614f34e/EN%20version%20-%20Frontcover.jpg)](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-eurekabio-reduce-vector-manufacturing-costs.html)\n\nPress Release\n\n[VectorBuilder and EurekaBio Join Forces to Reduce Viral Vector Manufacturing Costs](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-eurekabio-reduce-vector-manufacturing-costs.html)\n\nFeb 17, 2025\n\nVectorBuilder, a global expert in gene delivery technology, and EurekaBio, a leading upstream supplier in the CGT field, are proud to announce their synergistic strategic partnership. This alliance combines EurekaBio's revolutionary EuLV™ Stable Lentiviral Production System with VectorBuilder's GMP manufacturing and regulatory support expertise, aiming to accelerate the development of life-changing therapies worldwide. [Read More ››](/about-us/newsroom/vectorbuilder-eurekabio-reduce-vector-manufacturing-costs.html)\n\n-   1\n-   [2](/about-us/newsroom/page/2.html)\n-   [3](/about-us/newsroom/page/3.html)\n-   [](/about-us/newsroom/page/2.html)\n\nSubscribe to Newsroom\n\nFirst name \n\nLast name \n\nEmail \n\nInvalid email format.\n\nOrganization \n\nCountry/Region Country/Region {\\[country.display\\]} {\\[country.display\\]}\n\nState State/Province {\\[ state.name \\]}\n\nZip code \n\nCounty County {\\[ area \\]}\n\nPhone \n\n \n\nSubscribe\n\nPlease let us know what you would like to hear from us about the latest technologies or discoveries by **[contacting us](/about-us/contact.html)**.\n\n[Design My Vector](/design.html)\n\nDesign My Vector\n\n[Request Design Support](/design/request.html)\n\nRequest Design Support\n\n-   Order Support\n-   [Submit Materials](/resources/submit-materials.html)\n-   [Store Credit](/resources/promotion/store-credit.html)\n-   [Place Order](/resources/place-order.html)\n-   [Pay Invoice](/resources/pay-invoice.html)\n-   [Track Shipment](/resources/track-shipment.html)\n\n-   About Us\n-   [About VectorBuilder](/about-us/about-vectorbuilder.html)\n-   [Contact Us](/about-us/contact.html)\n-   [Careers](/about-us/careers.html)\n\n-   Social Media\n-   [Linkedln](https://www.linkedin.com/company/vectorbuilder)\n-   [X](https://twitter.com/VectorBuilder)\n-   [Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/@VectorBuilder)\n-   [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/VectorBuilder)\n\n-   Awards\n-   ![](//en.vectorbuilder.com/static/tmp/img/award1.d732b5224f3eb92c75cc6fa25b7df9e8.png.webp) ![](//en.vectorbuilder.com/static/tmp/img/award2.a6fa2c813742dd77a12709194c6dfe4a.png.webp) ![](//en.vectorbuilder.com/static/tmp/img/award3.b69802adbcdac12561141baa9da15707.png.webp) ![](//en.vectorbuilder.com/static/tmp/img/award4.4176c1075d42780ee2eb8a4c3538d627.png.webp)\n\nBy browsing our site, you accept cookies used to improve your experience. Our [privacy policy](/about-us/legal-statement/privacy-policy.html) can be found here. OK X\n\nVersion 2.1.1213 | Last update 2026-10-16 | Created by VectorBuilder Inc. | [Privacy Policy](/about-us/legal-statement/privacy-policy.html)"
