    "content": "  Novel BBB regulators verified with AAV9-X1.1 - CLOVER Center                                  \n\n[skip to main content](#content)\n\n[![Caltech](/static/core/img/caltech-new-logo.png)](https://www.caltech.edu)\n\n[CLOVER Center CLARITY, Optogenetics, & Vector Engineering](/)\n\n-   [AAV Repository](/aav-repository)\n    \n-   [ASPIRE Program](/aspire-program)\n    \n-   [Obtaining Reagents](/reagents)\n    \n-   [People](/People)\n    \n-   [Publications](/Publications)\n    \n-   [Contact](/Contact)\n    \n-   ![](/static/wagtail_menu/img/icon-search.png)\n    \n    SearchSearch\n    \n\nMenu ![](/static/wagtail_menu/img/menu-burger.png) \n\nClose\n\n-   [AAV Repository](/aav-repository)\n-   [ASPIRE Program](/aspire-program)\n-   [Obtaining Reagents](/reagents)\n-   [People](/People)\n-   [Publications](/Publications)\n-   [Contact](/Contact)\n\n![](/static/wagtail_menu/img/icon-search.png)\n\nSearchSearch\n\n[Home](/)  /  [News](/news)  /  Novel BBB regulators verified with AAV9-X1.1\n\n![sfbt](https://caltechsites-prod-assets.resources.caltech.edu/clover/images/Screen_Shot_2026-04-13_at_12.b8d90018.fill-1600x810-c100.jpg)\n\n# Novel BBB regulators verified with AAV9-X1.1\n\nApril 13, 2026\n\nFormer CLOVER Research Scientist Xinhong Chen, in collaboration with the laboratory of Jiefu Li at HHMI's Janelia Research Campus, used [AAV9-X1.1](/news/new-capsids-for-mouse-brain-endothelium-and-nhp-brain-neurons) to validate blood-brain barrier (BBB) regulators that the Li lab identified through luminal surface proteomics of the brain vasculature. The multi-institutional team reports that Slc7a1 is key to neonatal but not adult BBB maintenance, whereas HYAL2 is required throughout the mouse lifespan.\n\n#### Check out the full story in [Science](https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aea2100). Congrats Xinhong!\n\n![rebt](https://caltechsites-prod-assets.resources.caltech.edu/clover/images/Screen_Shot_2026-04-13_at_1.21.11_PM.d4de775f.width-450.png)\n\nImage Lightbox\n\n![rebt](https://caltechsites-prod-assets.resources.caltech.edu/clover/images/Screen_Shot_2026-04-13_at_1.21.11_.d4de775f.max-1400x800.png)\n\n[Download Full Image](https://caltechsites-prod-assets.resources.caltech.edu/clover/images/Screen_Shot_2026-04-13_at_1.21.11_PM.d4de775f.original.png?download=true)\n\n![](/static/theme-v7.0/img/flame.png)\n\n![Caltech](/static/core/img/caltech-new-logo.png)\n\nCalifornia Institute of Technology\n\n![](/static/theme-v7.0/img/icon-footerpin.png)\n\n1200 East California Boulevard\n\nPasadena, California 91125\n\n[Digital Accessibility](https://digitalaccessibility.caltech.edu/) | [Privacy Notice](https://www.caltech.edu/privacy-notice) | Site Content Copyright © 2026 | [Log In](https://clover.caltech.edu/admin/login/)"
